<title>USA: Morrison Q2 shr $0.08 vs pro forma $0.07.</title>
<headline>Morrison Q2 shr $0.08 vs pro forma $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Fresh Cooking, Inc.</p>
<p>Financial Results for the Second Quarter of Fiscal 1997</p>
<p>				   (000's)</p>
<p>						   For the 13 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>								   Pro Forma*</p>
<p>						  11/30/96	  12/2/95</p>
<p> Net sales				    $ 62,889	 $ 67,889</p>
<p> Net income					  690		657</p>
<p> Earnings/Common and Common Equiv shr     0.08	     0.07</p>
<p> Common and Common Equivalent Shares     9,073	    8,821</p>
<p>						   For the 26 Weeks Ended</p>
