<p> Common and Common Equivalent Shares     9,077	    8,854</p>
<p>*Pro Forma Common and equivalent shares are based on the number of shares of Morrison Restaurants Inc. Common Stock outstanding as of the effective date of the Spin-off, adjusted using the 1-for-4 distribution ratio.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
